                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "*Update Dec. 15, 2025: Development is on hold, but he hopes to finish it in the future.\n\n*Edit: I've located Rza Ibrahimov's social media pages. They were last active a year ago on YouTube, doing Blender videos. I have reached out to them via email concerning any updated content for The Strayed, as their ArtStation profile shows enhanced lighting, more levels, characters and a slightly updated UI.\n\nCheck out their socials & other work via ArtStation\nhttps://ibrahimov.artstation.com/resume\n\n==========\nIt's a good little platformer, maybe a bit unforgiving when first playing, but satisfying when you git gud. Enemy encounters respawn when changing areas. Pretty graphics. The key didn't work on the big door, so no idea if the underground areas in the preview are accessible, however, going in water killed me within a couple of seconds.\nIf using a controller, the buttons are\n\nMove: Left Stick\nAction: RB\nAttack: Triangle / Y\nJump, Menu select: Square / X\n\nWas it a real project that the author lost interest due to no takers?\nUnknown answer, but I would like to play more of it :(.",
